  regions:
    left and right each W cols wide
    exactly 2 distinct non-bg colors shared across both sides
    primary color 7-11 pixels in output, secondary color 3-5 pixels in output
    each side has 5-13 fg pixels; total fg fills 25-40% of one region
  fold_constraint:
